      "text": "O that ye would awake from sleep of hell, 2 Ne. 1:13. the Lord pours out deep sleep upon those that do iniquity, 2 Ne. 27:5 (Isa. 29:10). the Lord causes deep sleep to come upon Lamanites, Mosiah 24:19. the Lord awakened fathers out of deep sleep, Alma 5:7. Lamoni is not dead, but sleeps in God, Alma 19:8. lie down unto the Lord, that he may watch over you in your sleep, Alma 37:37. Lamanite guards are drunken and in deep sleep, Alma 55:15. Resurrection brings to pass redemption from endless sleep, Morm. 9:13.",
